  "notes": [
    "**Huir** is an -IR verb with spelling changes",
    "Present: spelling change adds \"y\" before vowel endings (huyo, huyes, huye, huyen) except nosotros",
    "Preterite: spelling change i→y in 3rd person (huyó, huyeron), accents on other forms (huí, huiste, huimos)",
    "Imperfect: regular -IR pattern with accent on \"í\" (huía, huías, etc.)",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: uses regular past participle **huido**",
    "Future: regular future endings attached to infinitive",
    "Used with \"de\": *huir de algo/alguien* (to flee from something/someone)",
    "Common usage: *huir del peligro* (to flee from danger), *huir de la justicia* (to flee from justice)",
    "Related noun: **la huida** (flight, escape)",
    "Similar pattern to **construir** (to build) and **destruir** (to destroy)"
  ],
